# Guide Studio — the team library (18 October 2026).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in both values to turn the team library on. Without them
# the tool runs as it always has: a library per browser, Backup and Restore to move a guide.
#
# Supabase → Project Settings → API:
#   Project URL  -> VITE_SUPABASE_URL
#   anon key     -> VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY   (public by design; supabase/migrations decides what it can reach)
# Then run supabase/migrations/0001_guides.sql in the SQL editor and add the team's emails to `team`.
#
# For the published tool, set the same two names as repository variables on GitHub
# (Settings → Secrets and variables → Actions → Variables); the Pages workflow passes them to the build.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
